s internally, so full-chapter calls are fine). MP3/M4B is optional post-step needing ffmpeg (not installed).\n18\t\n19\tPart of [[project_longview_session_synthesis]]. Blocked step: needs a session with the Voicebox MCP connected to actually generate the 14 wavs.\n20\t"}]},"uuid":"4633d72c-f093-4835-a4e9-f9d596e825bb","timestamp":"2026-07-03T17:35:05.976Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-nsdha-OneDrive-binary16\\memory\\longview_audiobook_workflow.md","content":"---\nname: longview_audiobook_workflow\ndescription: \"Prime-Silo audiobook pipeline turning THE-AI-VAMPIRE.md into a narrated WAV via Voicebox MCP, one chapter at a time, deterministic stitch\"\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: e6e3b312-3205-4169-87c7-97704c572fae\n---\n\nDeterministic 3-stage audiobook pipeline for the LONGVIEW book output. Lives at\n`%APPDATA%/space-agent/benny-home/benny/workspaces/longview/audiobook/` (not a git repo).\n\n- `01_prepare.py` — reads `../data_out/opus/sections/p{P}c{C}s{S}.md` (72 sections, 14 chapters, 4 parts), emits `build/chapters/chNN.txt` (audiobook-clean: strips `#`/TOC and all citation forms — `(sid: hex)` ×70 is the dominant one, plus `(concept:/doc:)`, `[longview_card_xxxx]` square-bracket refs, bare `foo_bar.md` tokens → de-underscored, inline code, `$LaTeX$`; announces each Part/Chapter by voice) + `build/manifest.json` (fixed order = numeric sort of filenames).\n- `02_synthesize.py` — driver/tracker only (`--status/--plan/--json`). Voicebox has NO CLI; it's a GUI+MCP app. The actual TTS = agent calls the Voicebox MCP generate tool per chapter (profile `Test`, a cloned voice, engine qwen 1.7B) and saves to `build/audio/chNN.wav`. Idempotent/resumable by wav presence.\n- `03_stitch.py` — stdlib `wave` concat in manifest order + inter-chapter silence gap (default 1200ms) → `build/THE-AI-VAMPIRE.wav` + `build/chapters.cue.txt`. No ffmpeg. Enforces uniform wav forma